"t-cmark\">[static]</span>\n</td>\n<td> the special value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, its exact meaning depends on the context</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/basic_string_view","title":"std::basic_string_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::npos","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. This is a special value equal to the maximum value representable by the type size_type."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"constexpr size_type npos [static]","note":"the special value size_type(-1), its exact meaning depends on the context"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":118,"codeBlockCount":1}
